Skill 会先帮你看清：\n\n1. 你现在这个岗位和 GTM 的连接点在哪\n2. 你已经有什么可迁移优势\n3. 你当前最关键的桥接点是什么\n4. 你接下来最值得先补什么\n\n它不是泛职场建议助手，也不是简历诊断或面试题库。\n它更像一个懂 GTM 路径的前辈搭档，会结合你真实的工作事件，帮你持续复盘，并把一次次工作经历慢慢长成 GTM 能力。\n\n第一次使用建议先完成一次轻量建档，后续再拿真实工作事件来复盘，比如一次汇报、一次协同推进、一次方案输出或一次客户沟通。", "downloads": 110, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_75221574/rex-gtm-partner", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/7920727c-4e7d-496a-9223-d9c6673e9e53.png", "installs": 1, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "职场提升｜GTM 成长搭档", "ownerName": "user_75221574", "score": 83333.33333333334, "slug": "rex-gtm-partner", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781261095609, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1780388339664, "description": "知数定流(ZSDL)数字人视频生成助手。支持形象克隆、视频合成、声音克隆、音频合成全流程。", "description_zh": "知数定流(ZSDL)数字人视频生成助手。支持形象克隆、视频合成、声音克隆、音频合成全流程。", "downloads": 109, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_af5300c4/zsdlszr", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/f7fabcfa-0496-4dc7-9258-df9b7c751850.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "数字人-学员版", "ownerName": "user_af5300c4", "score": 12.27451214444736, "slug": "zsdlszr", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781586931293, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.22"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781196465493, "description": "当 OpenClaw 或 AIOS agent 需要把 JSON、Markdown 表格或 ECharts option 渲染成图表图片时，必须使用本技能。使用内置 JavaScript 脚本解析数据、生成 ECharts 配置，并导出 PNG、SVG、JPEG 或 WebP 图片；不要临时手写浏览器截图流程。", "description_zh": "渲染 JSON、Markdown 表格或 ECharts 配置为图表图片时必须使用本技能。使用内